@startuml
!theme plain

title Alexandrite - tracing with alerting

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Customer / Partner API" as user

rectangle "Online Shop" as shop #LightBlue
rectangle "CRM" as crm #LightBlue
rectangle "MES" as mes #LightBlue
queue "RabbitMQ" as rabbit #LightBlue
database "Shop DB" as shopdb
database "MES DB" as mesdb
cloud "S3 Storage\n3D models" as s3

rectangle "OpenTelemetry Collector" as otel #FFCCCC
database "Tempo / Jaeger\nTrace Storage" as trace #FFCCCC
rectangle "Grafana\nTrace UI" as grafana #FFCCCC

rectangle "Order Flow Monitor" as flowmon #CCFFCC
rectangle "Alertmanager" as alertmanager #CCFFCC
actor "Support / DevOps" as support

user --> shop : HTTP request\ntraceparent
shop --> s3
shop --> rabbit : order event\ntraceparent + correlationId
rabbit --> crm
crm --> rabbit : production event
rabbit --> mes
mes --> rabbit : status event
rabbit --> crm

shop --> shopdb
crm --> shopdb
mes --> mesdb

shop --> otel : spans
crm --> otel : spans
mes --> otel : spans
rabbit --> otel : queue spans / metrics

otel --> trace : export traces
grafana --> trace : query traces

trace --> flowmon : order trace analysis
flowmon --> alertmanager : alert if order stuck
alertmanager --> support : notification

note right of flowmon
Green component.
Checks business flow:
- order stuck in status
- price calculation too long
- message in DLQ
- MES status not delivered to CRM
end note

@enduml